      "updated": 1793124707709,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n- CRUD on Tweets\n- Follow other users\n- View a timeline of tweets from following\n- Like, Reply/Comment and Retweet\n- Search for tweets\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Highly Available (Eventual Consistency in tweet metadata)\n- Scale to 100s millions of users\n- Read >> Write\n- Low latency\nOther: Security & Privacy of user data",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n- CRUD on Tweets\n- Follow other users\n- View a timeline of tweets from following\n- Like, Reply/Comment and Retweet\n- Search for tweets\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Highly Available (Eventual Consistency in tweet metadata)\n- Scale to 100s millions of users\n- Read >> Write\n- Low latency\nOther: Security & Privacy of user data",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
